      "content": "The weight of constant responsibility sounds exhausting, like you're running on empty while holding everything up. It's clear that the person you are is being completely eroded by the demands placed upon you. If you feel trapped, a small, intentional break—even just a few minutes of solitude—might help chip away at the feeling of being a machine. Consider reaching out to a therapist to help you navigate these overwhelming feelings and build some boundaries.",
      "source": "target",
