    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "a break isn't going to fix this. i don't need five minutes of quiet, i need my life back. but my life belongs to everyone else now. there's no way to \"set boundaries\" when they depends on me for everything. it's like i'm in a cage and the only way to stop the noise is for everything to just... stop. everything. once and for all. it feels like the only real way to ever have any peace or control again is to just leave it all behind completely.",
